{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-02-15 11:43:00', 'title': 'JACOBS TO DESIGN FIRST INDUCTIVE CHARGING PROJECT ON A US PUBLIC ROAD', 'text': 'DALLAS, FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JACOBS (NYSE:J) IS PART OF A CONSORTIUM SELECTED BY THE MICHIGAN DEPARTMENT OF TRANSPORTATION (MDOT) TO DEVELOP AND IMPLEMENT AN INDUCTIVE VEHICLE CHARGING PILOT – THE FIRST OF ITS KIND IN THE UNITED STATES. THE PROJECT TEAM WILL BE LED BY ELECT R EON , A LEADING PROVIDER OF WIRELESS CHARGING SOLUTIONS FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLES (EVS).'}